    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Drowning In Sorrow [4K]",
    "description": "Another wallpaper from me after a little over 3 weeks of hiatus. Took me quite a while to find a artwork that I like to animate, but I definitely like the vibes from this artwork.\n\nAlso, Happy April Fool's Day! Its definitely weird that I decided to release a wallpaper today, especially since the artwork is the direct opposite of what April Fool's Day should be, lighthearted and fun. For this artwork, its definitely more depressing and dark and honestly its probably the most \"sad\" wallpaper I have animated so far. I did not intend to release it today, it just happens that I finished animating the wallpaper on April 1st. While I could just release it the day after, I decided there's no point delaying uploading something that I already finished.\n\nDon't worry though, I did not animate some wacky shit into the artwork just because its April Fools, I still animate it like any other wallpaper I have made. Regardless, I hope you enjoy the wallpaper!\n\nMusic:\n\n[url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QHj6z1D8t3M] amies x cxlt. – Not The Same [/url]\n\nWallpaper can be found [url=https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/72668704] here [/url] (Made by catzz)\n\nAmbience sounds from ZapSplat & Mixkit.\n\nUpdate 1: Increased precision for music volume\n\nUpdate 2: Did some minor image editing\n\nUpdate 3: Adjusted bloom and pulse\n\nUpdate 4: Moved clock to the right to prevent it being obscured by desktop icons\n\nUpdate 5: Added date (disabled by default)",
