  {
    "id": "3746833443",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Resident Evil 4 - Interactive Attache Case Inventory",
    "description": "[h1]▲ FOR THE FULL EXPERIENCE (KEYBOARD CONTROLS) ▲[/h1]\r\nDue to security restrictions, keyboard input is blocked natively for web wallpapers. To enable full keyboard shortcuts (like rotating items with your keyboard):\r\n[list=1]\r\n[*]Open Wallpaper Engine, click [b]\"Open Wallpaper\"[/b] at the bottom left, and choose [b]\"Open from URL\"[/b].\r\n[*]Paste this link into the field and click OK: [url=https://sem-py.github.io/re4-inventory/]https://sem-py.github.io/re4-inventory/[/url]\r\n[*]On your desktop, press [b]ALT + K[/b] (or your assigned hotkey) to hide desktop icons and enable keyboard input.\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[hr][/hr]\r\n[url=https://sem-py.github.io/re4-inventory/][b]Play the website version here[/b][/url]\r\n\r\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/ZJWeUi0.gif[/img]\r\n\r\n[i]An interactive, fully physicalized inventory management wallpaper based on the classic Resident Evil 4 attache case. Perfect for organizing your digital space or just scratching that inventory-sorting itch right on your desktop.[/i]\r\n\r\n[h2]▲ FEATURES ▲[/h2]\r\n[list]\r\n[*][b]Fully Interactive Grid:[/b] Drag, drop, and organize classic RE4 items including weapons, ammo, herbs, and first aid sprays.\r\n[*][b]Tactile Audio:[/b] Sound effects taken directly from the original game when moving and rotating items.\r\n[*][b]Atmospheric Background Music:[/b] Moody, immersive ambient track that can be toggled on or off.\r\n[*][b]Minimalist Design:[/b] Clean, dark aesthetic optimized for desktop use without causing visual clutter.\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[h2]▲ CONTROLS ▲[/h2]\r\n[list]\r\n[*][b]Left Click:[/b] Pick up / Place item. (Spacebar works in URL version).\r\n[*][b]Rotate Held Item:[/b] Click the rotate button on the top-left of the grid (Or [b]R[/b] and [b]scroll wheel[/b] if you are using the URL version).\r\n[*][b]Arrow Keys:[/b] Move held item. (URL version only!).\r\n[*][b]ESC:[/b] Undo previous action. (URL version only!).\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[h2]▲ CREDITS ▲[/h2]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Designed by [b]orbyt[/b].\r\n[*]Original assets and audio properties belong to [b]Capcom[/b].\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[hr][/hr]\r\nIf you enjoy this project, please take a second to [b]Rate[/b] and [b]Favorite[/b]! Feedback and bug reports are always welcome in the comment section below.\r\n\r\n[b]Disclaimer:[/b] [i]This is an unofficial, non-profit fan-made project created strictly for entertainment purposes. This project is not affiliated with, authorized, or endorsed by Capcom. All Resident Evil assets and imagery are property of Capcom.[/i]",
